無論、Python で挑戦する俺様：

8<
[mahershalal rubyco] $ cat uniq.py
#!/usr/bin/python

def uniq(a):
    h={}
    for i in a:
        h[i] = h.get(i,0)+1
    return h.items()

print uniq( ["foo", "bar", "foo", "baz", "bar", "foo"] )
[mahershalal rubyco] $ python uniq.py
[('baz', 1), ('foo', 3), ('bar', 2)]
>8

